WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.140
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:17.410 --> 00:18.260
Qi Fengyin,

3
00:18.560 --> 00:19.100
are you all right?

4
00:21.600 --> 00:22.770
I'm not dying yet.

5
00:23.150 --> 00:23.610
My Lord,

6
00:23.630 --> 00:25.380
you nearly killed us just now.

7
00:29.960 --> 00:30.610
Qi Fengyin!

8
00:39.350 --> 00:40.140
What's wrong with him?

9
00:40.670 --> 00:41.630
His Lordship is fine.

10
00:41.840 --> 00:42.600
But what happened to you?

11
00:42.760 --> 00:43.720
You vanished

12
00:43.720 --> 00:44.460
without a word!

13
00:44.710 --> 00:45.870
Yamao and I looked everywhere for you.

14
00:45.870 --> 00:46.630
We were worried sick.

15
00:46.630 --> 00:47.290
What if something

16
00:47.310 --> 00:48.420
had happened to you?

17
00:48.420 --> 00:49.330
I went to look for this.

18
00:52.200 --> 00:52.690
Duyao,

19
00:53.030 --> 00:53.540
I'm sorry.

20
00:54.480 --> 00:54.970
I...

21
00:55.920 --> 00:56.780
Now that we have this,

22
00:57.110 --> 00:58.580
can we save your master?

23
01:08.190 --> 01:09.620
The ritual to repair the talisman

24
01:10.000 --> 01:10.760
was abruptly interrupted.

25
01:11.000 --> 01:11.510
Now,

26
01:11.750 --> 01:13.090
we can't fully repair it.

27
01:14.110 --> 01:15.700
Let's wait for Qi Fengyin to recover first.

28
01:16.030 --> 01:16.620
All right.

29
01:16.910 --> 01:18.450
But His Lordship

30
01:18.800 --> 01:20.340
seems to be getting worse and worse.

31
01:35.270 --> 01:36.680
It's the mark from the black dragon's fang.

32
01:40.330 --> 01:41.810
I knew something was wrong with him just now.

33
01:42.360 --> 01:43.550
So the venom's to blame.

34
01:44.990 --> 01:46.010
But why

35
01:46.670 --> 01:47.810
is it only taking effect now?

36
01:48.390 --> 01:48.890
Yamao,

37
01:49.720 --> 01:50.620
what can we do

38
01:50.880 --> 01:52.060
to neutralize the venom?

39
02:17.980 --> 02:23.860
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

40
02:25.900 --> 02:31.860
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

41
02:32.900 --> 02:37.140
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

42
02:40.820 --> 02:48.380
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

43
02:48.740 --> 02:55.500
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

44
02:56.740 --> 03:03.380
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

45
03:04.580 --> 03:11.420
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

46
03:13.020 --> 03:19.540
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

47
03:24.300 --> 03:26.100
[Blossom in Darkness]

48
03:26.100 --> 03:28.100
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

49
03:28.100 --> 03:31.100
[Episode 15]

50
03:38.320 --> 03:39.180
Hold on to me tight.

51
03:39.560 --> 03:40.380
Don't let go, all right?

52
03:41.470 --> 03:43.090
Until the venom is fully neutralized,

53
03:43.240 --> 03:43.970
you mustn't

54
03:43.970 --> 03:44.960
take the blindfold off either.

55
03:46.360 --> 03:47.660
Why do I need a blindfold?

56
03:48.630 --> 03:49.890
You said that when you opened your eyes,

57
03:50.150 --> 03:51.500
your recent memories would merge

58
03:51.520 --> 03:53.100
with memories from 1,000 years ago.

59
03:53.800 --> 03:54.980
I'm afraid you won't be able to take it

60
03:55.190 --> 03:55.940
and will lose control again.

61
03:56.240 --> 03:56.780
After all,

62
03:57.030 --> 03:58.540
you can't handle anything upsetting right now.

63
03:59.310 --> 04:00.540
The black dragon's venom

64
04:00.910 --> 04:02.500
seems to hold memories from 1,000 years ago.

65
04:03.080 --> 04:04.130
I just don't understand

66
04:04.680 --> 04:06.610
why it's only taking effect now.

67
04:09.630 --> 04:10.500
I can't figure it out either.

68
04:11.120 --> 04:12.380
Did you do something

69
04:12.680 --> 04:14.010
that made the venom spread?

70
04:26.870 --> 04:28.580
Could it have something to do with how I felt then?

71
04:31.480 --> 04:32.100
We're here.

72
04:44.110 --> 04:45.080
This is a cold spring

73
04:45.080 --> 04:46.380
on the hill out back of Mount Zhaowu.

74
04:46.640 --> 04:47.850
With Wuchang Prison right behind it,

75
04:48.160 --> 04:49.210
the water's icy cold.

76
04:49.640 --> 04:50.100
It's just

77
04:50.350 --> 04:51.650
what you need to calm your mind.

78
04:53.230 --> 04:54.650
All right. Come on. Take off your clothes.

79
04:56.670 --> 04:57.490
Take off my clothes?

80
04:58.350 --> 04:58.890
No.

81
05:00.190 --> 05:00.690
Why not?

82
05:03.480 --> 05:03.690
How...

83
05:03.910 --> 05:05.460
How can you soak in all those clothes?

84
05:09.760 --> 05:11.530
Don't tell me you're feeling shy.

85
05:16.840 --> 05:17.380
Turn around.

86
05:55.270 --> 05:56.460
How long do I have to soak here?

87
06:01.270 --> 06:02.170
About

88
06:02.910 --> 06:03.770
two hours.

89
06:04.600 --> 06:05.820
I've written out a prescription.

90
06:06.070 --> 06:06.690
Youyou and Duyao

91
06:06.690 --> 06:07.690
have split up to gather the herbs.

92
06:07.910 --> 06:08.820
None of them are rare.

93
06:09.070 --> 06:10.280
There are just a lot of different kinds.

94
06:10.480 --> 06:11.940
Once I've made the remedy,

95
06:12.320 --> 06:13.940
I'll help you break down the venom

96
06:14.240 --> 06:15.330
until it's completely neutralized.

97
06:20.680 --> 06:22.380
Then I'll repair the Demon Soul Talisman

98
06:23.150 --> 06:24.130
and save your master.

99
06:38.040 --> 06:39.020
Yamao

100
06:39.630 --> 06:40.580
sent Duyao and me

101
06:40.600 --> 06:41.570
to gather herbs separately.

102
06:42.300 --> 06:43.690
I bet she just wanted a moment alone

103
06:43.710 --> 06:45.100
with His Lordship at the cold spring.

104
06:47.300 --> 06:50.060
[Carpesium; Wormwood from Jiangning Prefecture]

105
06:52.960 --> 06:53.460
Found it.

106
07:00.710 --> 07:02.240
I can't believe that after 1,000 years,

107
07:02.420 --> 07:03.520
my talisman's still around.

108
07:04.430 --> 07:05.780
Once His Lordship repairs it,

109
07:06.150 --> 07:06.780
I'll find a chance

110
07:07.030 --> 07:08.180
to snatch it back from Yamao.

111
07:13.310 --> 07:13.900
After all,

112
07:14.270 --> 07:15.660
it's mine to begin with.

113
07:16.150 --> 07:17.180
I'm just

114
07:17.820 --> 07:18.800
taking back what's mine.

115
07:31.200 --> 07:31.850
Who's there?

116
08:00.990 --> 08:03.300
You kicked me when I was down last time.

117
08:03.840 --> 08:06.010
Now it's my turn to get even.

118
08:29.920 --> 08:30.500
I didn't know

119
08:30.500 --> 08:31.960
Mount Zhaowu had venomous sand wasps.

120
08:34.030 --> 08:35.730
Even with his spells to protect him,

121
08:36.430 --> 08:37.500
he's in for a nasty time.

122
08:52.840 --> 08:54.540
Help!

123
08:54.580 --> 08:55.530
Help!

124
08:55.530 --> 08:56.240
Go away!

125
08:56.400 --> 08:57.420
Help!

126
08:57.970 --> 08:58.340
Help...

127
08:58.710 --> 08:59.370
Go away! Shoo!

128
08:59.370 --> 09:00.050
Help!

129
09:00.710 --> 09:01.740
Go away!

130
09:06.160 --> 09:06.820
Come on!

131
09:07.760 --> 09:10.300
Wait! My... My foot's been stung!

132
09:11.600 --> 09:12.250
I'll carry you!

133
09:38.470 --> 09:38.860
Why didn't you

134
09:38.880 --> 09:40.510
kill all those venomous sand wasps?

135
09:41.200 --> 09:42.570
They really hold a grudge.

136
09:43.320 --> 09:44.380
Once they find an enemy,

137
09:44.760 --> 09:45.500
they'll never stop hounding them.

138
09:45.840 --> 09:46.900
All creatures around Mount Zhaowu

139
09:46.900 --> 09:47.500
are sentient beings.

140
09:47.910 --> 09:48.770
We mustn't kill needlessly.

141
09:56.400 --> 09:57.420
There's spiritual power in their stingers.

142
09:57.640 --> 09:58.180
You're a demon,

143
09:58.560 --> 09:59.090
so the stings

144
09:59.400 --> 10:00.890
hurt you more than they would an ordinary person.

145
10:04.230 --> 10:05.770
Every time I run into you, something goes wrong.

146
10:06.320 --> 10:07.330
I swear you're

147
10:07.350 --> 10:08.380
the world's biggest jinx!

148
10:09.150 --> 10:09.860
From now on,

149
10:10.110 --> 10:11.090
I'm staying well away from you!

150
10:13.840 --> 10:14.860
Are you laughing at me?

151
10:16.230 --> 10:16.980
Fine, you're right.

152
10:17.520 --> 10:18.980
It's all my fault you got stung.

153
10:19.590 --> 10:21.010
I tricked you into poking the hive

154
10:21.030 --> 10:22.210
and got venomous wasps after you.

155
10:24.100 --> 10:25.050
So, to make it up to you,

156
10:25.360 --> 10:26.450
I'll treat your wounds, all right?

157
11:15.840 --> 11:17.270
Once I get the talisman back and become

158
11:17.640 --> 11:18.530
a mighty demon again,

159
11:19.080 --> 11:20.540
I'll tear you limb from limb.

160
11:29.390 --> 11:30.850
Even if the talisman is repaired

161
11:31.750 --> 11:32.940
and Danshen comes back to life,

162
11:34.030 --> 11:34.850
neither of you

163
11:34.870 --> 11:35.730
is going anywhere.

164
11:36.150 --> 11:36.820
I know.

165
11:37.150 --> 11:38.580
I can't leave until your mystical flower blooms.

166
11:39.240 --> 11:39.820
Don't worry.

167
11:40.360 --> 11:41.980
I won't leave with my master

168
11:42.080 --> 11:43.460
until you've had your revenge.

169
11:44.320 --> 11:44.770
I won't allow it.

170
11:47.000 --> 11:48.440
Since when do I need your permission

171
11:48.720 --> 11:49.940
to be with my master?

172
11:56.150 --> 11:57.700
What are you sulking about now?

173
12:07.150 --> 12:08.610
You brought it up first.

174
12:24.960 --> 12:26.010
When Master wakes up,

175
12:26.960 --> 12:28.120
if he learns about what I've done

176
12:28.120 --> 12:29.300
to the immortal sects

177
12:30.120 --> 12:31.730
and about my relationship with Qi Fengyin,

178
12:33.390 --> 12:34.650
will he be angry?

179
12:35.560 --> 12:36.010
Senior Brother Lu,

180
12:37.600 --> 12:38.010
you first.

181
12:38.840 --> 12:39.730
After you, Junior Brother Li.

182
12:47.200 --> 12:47.780
Senior Brother Lu,

183
12:47.990 --> 12:48.730
after you.

184
12:49.750 --> 12:51.090
After you, Junior Brother Li.

185
12:52.120 --> 12:53.490
You're my senior brother. You first.

186
12:54.320 --> 12:55.220
You first, please.

187
13:55.480 --> 13:55.890
After you.

188
14:11.200 --> 14:11.770
Yamao,

189
14:13.120 --> 14:14.010
my blindfold's wet.

190
14:15.840 --> 14:17.220
That's all you have to say?

191
14:18.600 --> 14:19.250
Go get me a dry one.

192
14:21.960 --> 14:22.650
Qi Fengyin!

193
14:23.270 --> 14:24.180
You blockhead!

194
14:24.510 --> 14:25.220
You don't understand a thing!

195
14:42.790 --> 14:43.770
It's dark now.

196
14:48.750 --> 14:49.460
Be patient.

197
14:50.030 --> 14:52.010
It needs a little more time to heal.

198
15:15.510 --> 15:16.820
Next time you get angry,

199
15:17.150 --> 15:17.940
just come

200
15:18.240 --> 15:19.250
and beat me up.

201
15:19.750 --> 15:20.980
Don't provoke those venomous wasps again.

202
15:21.360 --> 15:22.220
You'd only hurt yourself

203
15:22.630 --> 15:24.100
more than the person you're after.

204
15:32.270 --> 15:32.890
Don't cry.

205
15:33.390 --> 15:34.530
I wasn't trying to make fun of you.

206
15:43.380 --> 15:44.650
You know I'm a demon.

207
15:45.240 --> 15:46.370
Why are you helping me?

208
15:46.750 --> 15:47.960
Are you trying to use me

209
15:48.120 --> 15:49.580
to find Qi Fengyin?

210
15:50.030 --> 15:51.420
- Of course not. I... - Forget it.

211
15:51.890 --> 15:52.420
Forget I asked.

212
15:53.270 --> 15:54.660
I couldn't care less

213
15:54.660 --> 15:55.650
what any of you think anyway.

214
15:58.320 --> 15:59.820
You sect lackeys are all the same.

215
16:01.270 --> 16:01.980
What?

216
16:09.120 --> 16:10.770
The venomous sand wasps outside are gone.

217
16:13.390 --> 16:14.060
Yes.

218
16:14.440 --> 16:15.420
At night...

219
16:45.910 --> 16:46.700
I'll never trust

220
16:46.720 --> 16:47.770
you sect lackeys.

221
17:08.110 --> 17:09.660
You've got the talisman.

222
17:10.680 --> 17:12.090
Why are you still on Mount Zhaowu?

223
17:14.790 --> 17:16.700
Are those all for Qi Fengyin?

224
17:18.400 --> 17:19.900
I won't let you take them.

225
17:22.440 --> 17:23.730
Mount Zhaowu's dispensary

226
17:24.270 --> 17:25.250
won't even look twice

227
17:25.270 --> 17:25.980
at these useless herbs.

228
17:26.350 --> 17:27.530
Why would I want them?

229
17:28.790 --> 17:31.140
I'm here to remind you

230
17:31.480 --> 17:33.090
that my master brought you to life

231
17:33.400 --> 17:34.420
from one of his artifacts.

232
17:35.070 --> 17:37.050
You should be on Mount Zhaowu's side.

233
17:37.400 --> 17:39.700
Choose the right side while you still can.

234
17:40.440 --> 17:41.810
If you stay with Qi Fengyin,

235
17:42.310 --> 17:44.490
you won't have long to live.

236
17:44.790 --> 17:46.380
Even if all the immortal sects joined forces,

237
17:46.720 --> 17:47.900
they'd still be no match for my brother.

238
17:48.240 --> 17:50.090
The Five Great Sects and all the rest

239
17:51.240 --> 17:52.770
are indeed no match for Qi Fengyin.

240
17:53.680 --> 17:54.660
But Mount Zhaowu

241
17:55.400 --> 17:57.050
has a weapon of immense power.

242
17:57.920 --> 17:59.010
Once awakened,

243
17:59.720 --> 18:01.160
it can easily reduce Qi Fengyin

244
18:01.160 --> 18:02.220
to dust.

245
18:03.350 --> 18:04.660
Stay with him,

246
18:05.370 --> 18:06.660
and you'll only end up

247
18:07.110 --> 18:08.330
dying with him.

248
18:10.120 --> 18:11.290
I... I don't believe you.

249
18:13.030 --> 18:14.940
To live or to die,

250
18:15.550 --> 18:16.860
it's up to you.

251
18:18.720 --> 18:19.490
What will your choice be?

252
18:35.110 --> 18:35.660
Hungry?

253
18:40.480 --> 18:41.140
Yamao,

254
18:43.200 --> 18:44.220
are you angry

255
18:45.200 --> 18:46.900
because it's improper for men and women to touch?

256
18:49.790 --> 18:51.220
So you do remember

257
18:51.510 --> 18:52.330
what I taught you.

258
19:00.750 --> 19:01.940
I can do right by you.

259
19:07.240 --> 19:08.770
I can marry you.

260
19:15.200 --> 19:15.980
Are you listening?

261
19:17.750 --> 19:18.580
Has the venom

262
19:18.580 --> 19:19.530
messed with your head?

263
19:19.530 --> 19:20.130
I know

264
19:20.130 --> 19:21.420
exactly what I'm saying.

265
19:22.500 --> 19:24.940
If we get married,

266
19:25.590 --> 19:26.900
then the next time this happens,

267
19:28.310 --> 19:29.730
you won't need to get angry with me.

268
19:32.920 --> 19:33.980
Getting married

269
19:34.270 --> 19:34.820
isn't

270
19:34.820 --> 19:36.300
about making it easier to stay together.

271
19:36.550 --> 19:38.090
You have to share a deep bond

272
19:38.370 --> 19:39.660
and love each other.

273
19:40.680 --> 19:42.180
You don't even understand love yet,

274
19:42.750 --> 19:43.940
and you don't have a thread of fate.

275
19:44.750 --> 19:45.570
So forget it.

276
19:50.270 --> 19:50.900
Yamao,

277
19:53.400 --> 19:55.140
I don't want to let you go

278
19:57.550 --> 19:58.730
even after the flower blooms.

279
20:19.810 --> 20:21.120
Don't you think

280
20:21.440 --> 20:22.740
things have been a little strange

281
20:22.950 --> 20:24.360
since he got back?

282
20:31.550 --> 20:32.180
Youyou,

283
20:33.670 --> 20:35.120
have you heard

284
20:36.920 --> 20:38.530
about that powerful weapon

285
20:38.530 --> 20:39.620
enshrined at Mount Zhaowu?

286
20:40.920 --> 20:41.570
I heard

287
20:42.310 --> 20:43.940
that once it's awakened,

288
20:44.830 --> 20:45.940
it'll instantly reduce my brother

289
20:46.000 --> 20:47.010
to dust.

290
20:48.510 --> 20:50.940
You mean the Saintess's Shrine?

291
20:51.720 --> 20:53.010
After Luoshen Valley was destroyed,

292
20:53.510 --> 20:54.420
it was moved here

293
20:54.440 --> 20:55.620
to Mount Zhaowu.

294
20:56.880 --> 20:57.980
What's that?

295
21:00.960 --> 21:02.700
Has no one told you

296
21:02.750 --> 21:04.220
you've fallen in with the wrong crowd?

297
21:04.920 --> 21:06.180
Well, let me tell you.

298
21:06.360 --> 21:08.120
His Lordship isn't a good man.

299
21:08.400 --> 21:10.250
He's the source of all evil,

300
21:10.440 --> 21:11.290
rejected by the whole world.

301
21:11.680 --> 21:12.660
Only the Saintess of the Tides

302
21:12.720 --> 21:13.700
can kill him.

303
21:13.920 --> 21:14.900
But she's been dormant

304
21:14.920 --> 21:16.010
for nearly 1,000 years.

305
21:16.270 --> 21:17.180
Who knows

306
21:17.200 --> 21:18.570
when she'll finally wake up?

307
21:20.880 --> 21:22.290
So that person wasn't lying.

308
21:23.070 --> 21:23.900
That thing

309
21:24.200 --> 21:25.940
really could kill my brother.

310
21:37.830 --> 21:39.290
I'll start the treatment now.

311
21:39.720 --> 21:41.490
It may hurt a little.

312
21:42.000 --> 21:43.380
Do your best to stay in control,

313
21:43.720 --> 21:44.380
all right?

314
22:16.240 --> 22:16.770
This is...

315
22:17.960 --> 22:19.090
We're in the black dragon's memories.

316
22:19.440 --> 22:20.770
How did I get pulled in too?

317
22:30.030 --> 22:31.530
Well, I'm exhausted.

318
22:32.000 --> 22:33.380
I've already written two whole lines.

319
22:34.070 --> 22:35.660
That's enough hard work for today.

320
22:37.240 --> 22:38.220
This is you 1,000 years ago,

321
22:38.920 --> 22:39.530
before you

322
22:39.550 --> 22:40.620
were sealed away on Mount Qihuang.

323
22:41.400 --> 22:42.810
Who's that woman in white?

324
22:43.590 --> 22:44.490
Is she the sworn enemy

325
22:45.240 --> 22:46.940
you said tormented you for thousands of years?

326
22:47.590 --> 22:48.180
Qi Fengyin,

327
22:49.200 --> 22:50.570
have you heard of the Wish Tree?

328
22:53.550 --> 22:54.250
No.

329
23:05.030 --> 23:05.570
So

330
23:06.510 --> 23:07.900
you knew about the Wish Tree long ago.

331
23:14.310 --> 23:15.220
Qi Fengyin,

332
23:16.510 --> 23:17.860
you'll have to

333
23:19.240 --> 23:20.900
face the next 1,000 years alone.

334
23:25.000 --> 23:26.380
Even if it takes my whole life,

335
23:27.880 --> 23:29.050
whatever the cost,

336
23:31.920 --> 23:33.660
I'll bring you back to life.

337
23:51.830 --> 23:52.380
What's wrong?

338
23:53.510 --> 23:54.660
Is the venom neutralized?

339
23:58.200 --> 23:58.770
Yamao...

340
24:01.680 --> 24:02.900
What's with that look?

341
24:03.680 --> 24:04.770
It's as if you've

342
24:04.790 --> 24:06.090
done me wrong.

343
24:06.920 --> 24:07.770
Don't overthink things.

344
24:08.510 --> 24:10.090
Hurry up and repair the talisman.

345
24:12.200 --> 24:13.420
I'm going to bask in the moonlight.

346
24:16.830 --> 24:17.530
I'll come with you.

347
24:17.640 --> 24:17.940
No need.

348
24:23.310 --> 24:23.900
My Lord,

349
24:24.240 --> 24:25.810
maybe you should go check on Yamao.

350
24:26.030 --> 24:27.290
She's acting a little strange.

351
25:18.920 --> 25:19.490
Yamao,

352
25:21.070 --> 25:22.900
what's going on with you and His Lordship?

353
25:23.440 --> 25:24.660
Something seems a little off

354
25:24.920 --> 25:25.900
between you two.

355
25:26.920 --> 25:28.770
You're being paranoid.

356
25:31.880 --> 25:33.730
I just never thought

357
25:34.550 --> 25:35.500
that black dragon

358
25:35.500 --> 25:36.900
would actually do some good in the end.

359
25:38.400 --> 25:40.010
It showed Qi Fengyin

360
25:40.030 --> 25:41.010
his memories from 1,000 years ago.

361
25:42.000 --> 25:43.220
He got it all wrong.

362
25:44.680 --> 25:45.290
The spirit in the flower

363
25:45.480 --> 25:46.730
doesn't belong to his enemy.

364
25:47.440 --> 25:49.290
It belongs to the love of his life.

365
25:55.030 --> 25:56.220
So His Lordship

366
25:56.310 --> 25:57.490
really did have a...

367
26:02.860 --> 26:04.820
Yamao, are you all right?

368
26:07.590 --> 26:08.330
Why wouldn't I be?

369
26:08.750 --> 26:10.180
Of course I'm happy for him.

370
26:10.750 --> 26:11.420
Love

371
26:11.550 --> 26:12.810
is better than hate, right?

372
26:13.920 --> 26:14.660
You should head back.

373
26:15.240 --> 26:16.620
Let me bask in the moonlight alone.

374
26:17.110 --> 26:18.420
I need to be full of energy when I

375
26:18.420 --> 26:19.180
welcome my master back!

376
26:21.680 --> 26:23.140
Don't you feel

377
26:23.640 --> 26:26.730
even a little jealous or hurt?

378
26:29.160 --> 26:30.570
You've spent so much time together.

379
26:30.880 --> 26:31.900
Haven't you developed

380
26:32.270 --> 26:33.290
special feelings

381
26:33.750 --> 26:35.140
for him?

382
26:35.510 --> 26:36.980
You... You're being weird.

383
26:37.200 --> 26:38.290
You're the one being weird.

384
27:14.270 --> 27:15.180
Why am I crying?

385
27:17.790 --> 27:18.700
Shouldn't I

386
27:20.590 --> 27:21.810
be happy for Qi Fengyin?

387
27:23.590 --> 27:24.700
Why am I crying?

388
27:29.000 --> 27:30.180
Do I have feelings for Qi Fengyin?

389
27:36.070 --> 27:37.050
Impossible.

390
27:38.110 --> 27:39.090
I'm no fool.

391
27:39.830 --> 27:41.050
How could I not know how I feel

392
27:41.070 --> 27:41.900
about someone?

393
27:42.720 --> 27:44.770
From the start, my master

394
27:45.960 --> 27:47.570
has been the only one in my heart.

395
27:48.350 --> 27:50.090
There's no way I'd feel jealous or upset

396
27:50.270 --> 27:52.180
over Qi Fengyin.

397
28:11.240 --> 28:11.980
This is frustrating.

398
28:13.960 --> 28:15.330
Why am I so upset?

399
28:35.400 --> 28:35.940
Big Brother,

400
28:37.590 --> 28:38.910
if I were in danger

401
28:39.270 --> 28:40.290
and someone tried to kill me,

402
28:41.640 --> 28:42.730
would you protect me?

403
28:43.550 --> 28:43.900
Yes.

404
28:45.960 --> 28:46.570
I would too.

405
28:47.480 --> 28:48.980
I won't let anyone

406
28:49.480 --> 28:50.660
or anything hurt you.

407
28:51.680 --> 28:52.660
Why do you ask?

408
28:57.680 --> 28:58.250
Big Brother,

409
28:58.880 --> 29:00.220
I'm about to do something important.

410
29:01.070 --> 29:01.420
I don't know

411
29:01.440 --> 29:03.290
if I'll make it back to you,

412
29:04.000 --> 29:05.620
but I'll always remember your face.

413
29:34.680 --> 29:35.380
It's blooming!

414
29:40.590 --> 29:41.250
We're about to make it!

415
29:42.680 --> 29:43.730
You seem really happy.

416
29:49.240 --> 29:49.770
Now,

417
29:49.960 --> 29:50.770
it's your turn

418
29:50.790 --> 29:51.820
to repair the talisman for me.

419
29:51.820 --> 29:52.390
The talisman!

420
29:53.590 --> 29:54.660
Whether I see my master again

421
29:54.750 --> 29:55.490
depends entirely on you.

422
30:24.440 --> 30:25.290
Once I destroy it,

423
30:26.240 --> 30:27.180
nothing in this world

424
30:27.200 --> 30:28.180
can hurt my brother again.

425
30:57.750 --> 30:58.980
This may be underhanded,

426
30:59.520 --> 31:01.220
but once she touches the shrine,

427
31:01.680 --> 31:02.930
the memories and power it holds

428
31:02.930 --> 31:03.980
will return to her.

429
31:04.880 --> 31:05.940
She'll remember

430
31:05.940 --> 31:07.220
that she isn't Duyao at all,

431
31:08.250 --> 31:10.060
and that she certainly isn't Qi Fengyin's lackey.

432
31:16.920 --> 31:17.840
What's going on?

433
31:21.510 --> 31:22.600
That sign seems to suggest

434
31:23.790 --> 31:25.300
a deity has descended.

435
31:29.160 --> 31:29.660
Where's Duyao?

436
32:02.620 --> 32:05.860
[Strive to Cultivate Noble Virtue]

437
32:25.400 --> 32:27.810
We welcome your return, Saintess of the Tides!

438
32:30.240 --> 32:33.180
We welcome your return, Saintess of the Tides!

439
32:35.750 --> 32:37.570
So my purpose in this world

440
32:44.880 --> 32:46.330
is to kill him.

441
33:08.590 --> 33:10.090
What does getting married really mean?

442
33:10.400 --> 33:12.220
If two people marry

443
33:12.240 --> 33:13.050
beneath the Wish Tree,

444
33:13.240 --> 33:15.440
their fates become entwined,

445
33:15.510 --> 33:17.070
and they'll never part as long as they live.

446
33:33.200 --> 33:34.380
Why the long face?

447
33:34.680 --> 33:35.860
Isn't that an auspicious sign from Heaven?

448
33:36.510 --> 33:37.900
Something wonderful must be about to happen.

449
33:38.790 --> 33:40.180
An auspicious sign from Heaven

450
33:41.240 --> 33:42.140
can't be good news

451
33:42.160 --> 33:43.090
for two fiends like you

452
33:43.110 --> 33:44.050
and Qi Fengyin, can it?

453
33:45.110 --> 33:46.290
And at a time like this,

454
33:47.200 --> 33:48.420
I have a feeling something's about to happen.

455
33:54.510 --> 33:55.010
Catch.

456
33:57.960 --> 33:58.980
Use it to save your master.

457
34:00.110 --> 34:01.250
You fixed it already?

458
34:12.320 --> 34:12.780
I was right.

459
34:13.070 --> 34:14.780
It was formed from my demonic core.

460
34:15.030 --> 34:16.170
Return it once you're done.

461
34:46.150 --> 34:46.820
Duyao?

462
34:47.110 --> 34:47.880
Why do you seem

463
34:47.880 --> 34:49.130
like a different person?

464
34:54.110 --> 34:55.090
She isn't Duyao.

465
34:56.070 --> 34:57.490
Qi Fengyin is right.

466
34:58.670 --> 35:00.410
Duyao no longer exists.

467
35:01.200 --> 35:01.860
Or rather,

468
35:03.070 --> 35:04.940
she never existed at all.

469
35:14.440 --> 35:15.330
The Crystal Orb?

470
35:16.510 --> 35:17.900
It's the Saintess of the Tides' divine artifact.

471
35:20.600 --> 35:22.540
So Duyao is the Saintess of the Tides?

472
35:22.790 --> 35:24.650
The moment I touched the shrine

473
35:25.600 --> 35:27.090
and fully regained

474
35:27.110 --> 35:27.900
my divine consciousness,

475
35:28.320 --> 35:29.370
everything I was before

476
35:29.390 --> 35:31.180
ceased to exist.

477
35:33.280 --> 35:34.970
The sole purpose of my awakening

478
35:36.860 --> 35:39.050
is to kill Qi Fengyin.

479
35:40.390 --> 35:41.660
Since you're here to kill me,

480
35:42.470 --> 35:44.300
let these two leave first.

481
35:46.640 --> 35:47.140
Get back!

482
35:53.670 --> 35:55.010
You've spent so much time with us.

483
35:55.270 --> 35:56.000
You should know

484
35:56.070 --> 35:56.580
Qi Fengyin

485
35:56.600 --> 35:58.010
isn't some vicious monster.

486
35:58.080 --> 35:58.770
What happened

487
35:58.800 --> 36:00.210
between you two 1,000 years ago

488
36:00.280 --> 36:01.900
that makes you so determined to kill him?

489
36:02.600 --> 36:03.580
This has nothing to do with a grudge.

490
36:05.190 --> 36:06.890
It's our destiny.

491
36:46.000 --> 36:46.500
Yamao!

492
36:49.550 --> 36:50.170
Stay away from mirrors.

493
36:59.750 --> 37:00.260
My Lord,

494
37:00.510 --> 37:01.260
can't we find a way

495
37:01.280 --> 37:02.450
to break out of the Crystal Orb?

496
37:02.910 --> 37:03.890
If it shatters,

497
37:04.350 --> 37:05.730
so will we.

498
37:06.160 --> 37:06.930
Then what do we do?

499
37:07.320 --> 37:09.050
There's no way out.

500
37:09.350 --> 37:10.610
We can't just stand here waiting to die.

501
37:11.280 --> 37:11.820
My master

502
37:12.350 --> 37:14.050
guarded the Saintess's Shrine for 1,000 years.

503
37:14.630 --> 37:15.770
If he wakes up in time,

504
37:16.070 --> 37:16.880
he'll find a way

505
37:16.880 --> 37:17.730
to plead with her for us.

506
37:23.030 --> 37:23.610
Master...

507
37:41.380 --> 37:42.110
Yamao!

508
38:08.030 --> 38:08.820
You knew the talisman

509
38:08.840 --> 38:09.820
could save his life.

510
38:10.720 --> 38:12.100
He was your guardian for 1,000 years.

511
38:12.880 --> 38:14.330
He ended up like this

512
38:14.350 --> 38:15.540
while protecting your shrine.

513
38:16.440 --> 38:16.890
How could you

514
38:16.910 --> 38:18.490
treat your own guardian like this?

515
38:26.560 --> 38:27.930
You don't deserve my master's

516
38:27.930 --> 38:28.860
1,000 years of devotion!

517
38:29.620 --> 38:31.170
Some deity you are!

518
38:31.600 --> 38:32.420
I'll never recognize you as one!

519
38:48.610 --> 38:49.250
Yamao.

520
38:49.360 --> 38:51.130
Yamao, calm down.

521
38:51.240 --> 38:52.410
Hurry and think of something.

522
38:52.410 --> 38:53.940
Once His Lordship's power runs out,

523
38:53.940 --> 38:55.100
we're all doomed.

524
38:56.100 --> 38:58.450
Youyou, there's nothing I can do.

525
38:59.030 --> 39:00.220
She's the Saintess of the Tides.

526
39:00.420 --> 39:01.820
I can't save my master

527
39:02.320 --> 39:03.580
or anyone else.

528
39:03.790 --> 39:04.860
My Demon Soul Talisman

529
39:04.880 --> 39:05.610
is in pieces,

530
39:05.810 --> 39:07.680
and I'm not moping like you.

531
39:09.620 --> 39:10.610
The Demon Soul Talisman...

532
39:15.480 --> 39:17.060
It was formed from my demonic core.

533
39:17.830 --> 39:19.630
It's a rare artifact of immense spiritual power

534
39:19.800 --> 39:20.730
that can reach into the past.

535
39:21.710 --> 39:22.340
If

536
39:22.680 --> 39:23.250
it can regain

537
39:23.270 --> 39:24.420
its original power,

538
39:25.800 --> 39:27.570
it might just help us survive.

539
39:36.490 --> 39:37.570
It's my talisman.

540
39:37.570 --> 39:39.180
I can make it work even if it's reduced to ash.

541
39:56.590 --> 39:58.810
Yamao, this portal leads to the past.

542
39:59.120 --> 40:00.570
Find the mighty ancient demon I used to be.

543
40:00.880 --> 40:02.170
This is our only chance to survive.

544
40:02.360 --> 40:04.250
She'll use her talisman to save you.

545
40:05.000 --> 40:05.570
Hurry!

546
40:09.440 --> 40:10.050
Take her with you.

547
40:10.240 --> 40:11.170
I'll keep the portal open.

548
40:11.590 --> 40:12.930
Keep arguing, and none of us will get out.

549
40:13.360 --> 40:14.490
They can't kill me.

550
40:15.040 --> 40:16.220
You must both stay alive.

551
40:16.480 --> 40:17.540
Remember to come back and save me.

552
40:52.320 --> 40:54.100
Saintess, you came to kill Qi Fengyin.

553
40:54.590 --> 40:55.900
She... She's innocent.

554
40:56.150 --> 40:57.050
Please spare her life.

555
40:57.320 --> 40:57.980
Qingxing?

556
41:05.800 --> 41:07.300
Where did you send them?

557
41:30.560 --> 41:31.490
Where am I?

558
41:31.490 --> 41:34.060
[Nine hundred years ago]

559
41:44.150 --> 41:45.340
I got separated from Qi Fengyin too.

560
41:50.710 --> 41:51.460
Where's my ring?

561
41:53.630 --> 41:54.460
No wonder my scent

562
41:54.480 --> 41:55.250
is spreading.

563
42:21.440 --> 42:22.690
I've got my eye on her.

564
42:23.440 --> 42:24.170
Now get lost!

565
42:52.840 --> 42:54.010
Your future self, 900 years from now,

566
42:54.230 --> 42:55.210
sent me here

567
42:55.220 --> 42:56.090
to borrow your Demon Soul Talisman.

568
42:56.090 --> 42:57.130
Who are you to even mention

569
42:57.630 --> 42:58.880
the Demon Soul Talisman?

570
42:58.920 --> 42:59.980
The Moonlit Revival Herb

571
43:00.400 --> 43:01.490
is a rare treasure.

572
43:01.760 --> 43:03.250
I'll chop you to pieces

573
43:03.250 --> 43:04.370
and make a lavish feast of you.

574
43:04.480 --> 43:05.900
These shackles can only hold one person.

575
43:06.110 --> 43:07.010
What if she finds out

576
43:07.360 --> 43:09.130
you're staying here in my place?

577
43:09.670 --> 43:10.940
This way, she won't be able to tell.

578
43:31.580 --> 43:35.620
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

579
43:35.860 --> 43:39.300
♪So many longings♪

580
43:39.980 --> 43:42.060
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

581
43:42.260 --> 43:47.260
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

582
43:48.180 --> 43:52.220
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

583
43:52.460 --> 43:55.900
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

584
43:56.580 --> 43:58.660
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

585
43:58.860 --> 44:06.260
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

586
44:07.660 --> 44:11.340
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

587
44:11.580 --> 44:15.260
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

588
44:15.900 --> 44:19.460
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

589
44:19.780 --> 44:23.940
♪Still waits to come true♪

590
44:24.180 --> 44:27.860
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

591
44:28.420 --> 44:32.060
♪I'll stay by your side♪

592
44:32.540 --> 44:36.140
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

593
44:36.380 --> 44:43.700
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

594
44:57.180 --> 45:01.220
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

595
45:01.460 --> 45:04.900
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

596
45:05.580 --> 45:07.660
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

597
45:07.820 --> 45:15.260
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

598
45:16.180 --> 45:19.860
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

599
45:20.460 --> 45:24.060
♪I'll stay by your side♪

600
45:24.580 --> 45:28.140
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

601
45:28.380 --> 45:35.700
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
